{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-idle-nonhaptog-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.73, step 7f. `scale-county-idle-nonhaptog`: NonHAPTOG (88) and its mechanism pseudo-pollutant (3000, `NonHAPTOG Mechanism`, mechanism 5 -- the only chemical mechanism MOVES5 ships, and the only one `integratedSpeciesSet` holds) at running and start exhaust, extended idle, auxiliary power and crankcase running, start and extended idle, for source types 21 and 62 on road types 1 and 4, over the county database of `scale-county-idle-species` (`inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg.esm`), at `<aggregateBy key=\"Hour\"/>` and `<outputtimestep value=\"Hour\"/>`: July 2020, weekdays, hours 7 and 8. Beside them every prerequisite TOGSpeciationCalculator.getMechanismRequirements and the chain expand them to: NMOG and the fourteen integrated species, and THC, NMHC and VOC at the rated processes. MOVESOutput is 67,752 rows, 33,876 per hour.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is where TOGSpeciationCalculator writes NonHAPTOG. It registers 88 at every process `rocspeciation` gives a TOG profile and runs wherever the MECHANISM is selected on the iteration's process (doExecute's `mechanismIDs`), and the SQL writes 88 rows from NMOG minus the integrated species, whether or not 88 is selected there. NonHAPTOG is a pollutant-process only at running exhaust and crankcase running (8801, 8815); MOVES writes it at all seven -- at start, crankcase start, crankcase extended idle, extended idle and APU from the mechanism row alone. At every process it is NMOG minus the fourteen species on the process's OWN rows (crankcase rows included: TOGSpeciation runs on CrankcaseEmissionCalculator's copies, not a copy of running's 88), clamped at zero.\n\n`n_outputRate` is bound to 33876, the (pollutant-process, cohort) pairs per (county, month, hour cell); `n_physicsRow` 21, the two source types' physics rows.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "off-network-idle",
      "air-toxics",
      "hc-speciation",
      "crankcase",
      "nonhaptog",
      "mechanism",
      "start-exhaust",
      "running-exhaust"
    ]
  },
